      "zh-Hant": "蘇軍越界與兩個方面軍",
      "en": "The Red Army crosses with two fronts"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "美國陸軍戰史專書（Kennedy）寫道，1939年9月17日0200，史達林通知德國大使，蘇軍當天進入波蘭。蘇聯紅軍以兩個稱為「方面軍」的集團軍群越過邊界進入波蘭東部。",
      "en": "Kennedy's US Army study says that at 0200 on 17 September 1939 Stalin informed the German ambassador that Soviet troops would enter Poland that day. The Red Army crossed into eastern Poland with two army groups, called fronts."
     },
