     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "Kennedy 記載，北面的白俄羅斯方面軍由「集團軍指揮員」科瓦廖夫（Kovalev）指揮，司令部設在明斯克。書中未寫其名字與父名。",
      "en": "Kennedy records that the White Russian Front in the north was commanded by Army Commander Kovalev, with headquarters in Minsk. The study gives no first name or patronymic."
