     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "同書指出，該方面軍的第三集團軍負責向布列斯特與比亞韋斯托克推進。南面的烏克蘭方面軍則由季莫申科指揮。",
      "en": "The study adds that the front's Third Army was assigned to advance on Brzesc and Bialystok. The Ukrainian Front to the south was commanded by Army Commander Timoshenko."
